    <string name="wow_server_pc_title">Play from a PC</string>
    <string name="wow_server_pc_body">On a PC on the same Wi-Fi, in your 3.3.5a client\'s folder, open Data\\enUS\\realmlist.wtf and make its line\n\nset realmlist %1$s\n\nthen start Wow.exe and log in with one of your accounts. The phone has to stay on this Wi-Fi with the server running.</string>
